<title>USA: Paul Harris March same store sales up.</title>
<headline>Paul Harris March same store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paul Harris Stores Inc said Thursday that its same store sales in March rose 18 percent.</p>
<p>Net sales for the four weeks of March 1997 rose 20 percent to $19.8 million from $16.5 million a year ago.</p>
<p>&quot;We are very pleased with our March sales and comps,&quot; Charlotte Fischer, chairman, said in a statement. &quot;We experienced very positive sales of our spring fashions and continue to show strength in our private label brand.&quot;</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
